{
  "uid": "lab5-sala1",
  "title": "Lab 5 — Sala 1: temperatura, humedad e iluminancia",
  "tags": [
    "lab5",
    "mqtt"
  ],
  "timezone": "America/Bogota",
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-4d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Qué mira el operador",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Sala 1 — ambiente (MQTT → InfluxDB → Grafana).** El operador vigila que la **temperatura no supere 30 °C** (línea roja; dispara la alerta *Temperatura alta sala1*), la humedad entre 40–80 % y la luz entre 100–900 lux en horario diurno. Ventana: últimos 4 días."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Temperatura actual",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influx-lab5"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "celsius",
          "min": 15,
          "max": 35,
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 28
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 30
              }
            ]
          },
          "displayName": "Temperatura"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "influx-lab5"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: v.defaultBucket)\n  |> range(start: -10m)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"ambiente\" and r._field == \"temperature\")\n  |> last()\n  |> keep(columns: [\"_time\",\"_value\"])"
        }
      ]
    },
